# Accuracy reports

Ground truth is NGSPICE using the identical BSIM-CMG LEVEL=72 OSDI model.
See [`methodology.md`](methodology.md) for gate and evidence rules.

## Current NN policy

DirectNet-Full LEVEL=75 is the default NN path. BSIM-AR-Full LEVEL=76 is the
autoregressive alternative. LEVEL=73/74 reports are historical evidence only.

## Current reports

| file | scope |
|---|---|
| [`DirectNet-L75-clean.md`](DirectNet-L75-clean.md) | latest LEVEL=75 clean qualification and gaps |
| [`BSIM-AR-L76-simple-circuits.md`](BSIM-AR-L76-simple-circuits.md) | TSMC5 LEVEL=76 recovery; not a five-tech matrix |
| [`simple-circuits-v2-topologies.md`](simple-circuits-v2-topologies.md) | held-out topology and promotion contract |

